    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12090" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cyănŏs</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-us</span></b> , i, m.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύανος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The blue corn-flower, blue-bottle</i>: Centaurea
			cyanus, Linn.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 21, 8, 24, § 48</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">21, 11, 39, §
				68</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A precious stone, a species of</i> lapis lazuli,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				37, 9, 38, § 119</span></i>.</div>
